{
  "id": "JDG.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Aamuli 11",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiko Giliadi kpwakala na mwanajeshi sujaa yeihwa Jefutha. Iye wavyalwa ni Giliadi na mchetu yekala malaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giliadi wakala na ana anjina a chilume ario wavyala na mchewe mwenye. Anae aha ariphokala avyere, amzola Jefutha achimuamba, “Uwe kundarisi mali za baba, mana mayoo kalórerwe ni baba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho Jefutha wachimbira nduguze achendasagala mudzi wa Tobu. Kuko atu ayi akpwendadziunga naye na achikala nkuphiya phamwenga kpwenye vyaro vya kpwendashambuliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya muda, atu a Aamoni apigana na Aiziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aamoni ariphopigana na Aiziraeli, vilongozi a Giliadi aphiya Tobu kpwendagomba na Jefutha ili auye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amuamba, “Huphiye ukalongoze jeshi rehu, ripigane na Aamoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jefutha waajibu vilongozi a Giliadi achiaambira, “Avi mwanirema na mchinizola kula kpwa nyumba ya baba? Vino mkaona muna tabu ndipho munanilunga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vilongozi a Giliadi achimuamba Jefutha, “Ni kpweli hunatabu ndiyo mana vivi hukedzakulunga, uphiye naswi ukapigane na Aamoni, na uwe undakala chilongozi wa atu osi asagalao Giliadi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jefutha achiauza hara vilongozi a Giliadi, “Dze! Nchiuya phamwenga namwi kpwendapigana na Aamoni na Mwenyezi Mlungu aniwezeshe kuaturya, muna hakika ndaenderera kukala chilongozi wenu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao vilongozi a Giliadi achimuamba Jefutha, “Mwenyezi Mlungu andakala shaidi kahi yehu, hunaahidi kukala hundahenda vira urivyoamba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Jefutha waphiya phamwenga na vilongozi a Giliadi, nao achimuhenda chilongozi wao na chilongozi wa jeshi. Chisha Jefutha wagomba tsona gara maneno ga mapatano gao mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu hiko Mizipa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jefutha wahuma ahumwa kpwa mfalume wa Aamoni akamuuze, “Unamini we hata unalonda kupigana nami kpwa sababu ya tsi yangu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye mfalume wa Aamoni waajibu hara ahumwa a Jefutha achiamba, “Kpwa sababu Iziraeli yahala tsi yangu wakati ariphotuluka Misiri, kula muho Arinoni urio mwakani hadi muho Jaboki urio vurini na seemu yosi hadi muho Joridani urio mtswerero wa dzuwa. Vivi niuyizira tsi iyo kpwa amani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jefutha wahuma tsona ahumwa kpwa mfalume wa Aamoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nao achimuamba, “Jefutha anakuamba hivi: Aiziraeli taayahala tsi ya Moabu wala tsi ya Aamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wakati Aiziraeli ariphotuluka Misiri, atsupira jangbwani hadi achifika Bahari ya Shamu na achifika Kadeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.20.14+NUM.20.15+NUM.20.16+NUM.20.17+NUM.20.18+NUM.20.19+NUM.20.20+NUM.20.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 20:14–21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho Kadeshi, ahuma ahumwa akavoye ruhusa kpwa mfalume wa Edomu achiamba, ‘Huruhusu hutsapire tsiiyo,’ ela mfalume wa Edomu achirema. Piya mfalume wa Moabu wahumirwa ujumbe uho ela piya naye achirema. Kpwa hivyo Aiziraeli achisala ko Kadeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 21:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye Aiziraeli atsupira hiko jangbwani, achizunguluka tsi za Edomu na Moabu hadi ariphofika mlairo wa dzuwa wa tsi ya Moabu, achichita kambi hiko ngʼambo ya muho Arinoni. Ela taayainjira seemu ya Moabu, mana Muho Arinoni wakala ndio mphaka wa tsi ya Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 21:21–24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Aiziraeli ahuma atu kpwa Sihoni mfalume wa Aamori yetawala kula Heshiboni achimuamba, ‘Hunakuvoya huruhusu utsupire tsiiyo ili hufike tsi yehu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Sihoni kayaamini Aiziraeli kutsupira tsiiye, kpwa hivyo wakusanya majeshige gosi achichita kambi hiko Jahaza na achipigana na Aiziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli watiya Sihoni phamwenga na jeshire rosi mikononi mwa Aiziraeli, nao Aiziraeli achiaturya na tsi yosi ya Aamori ichihalwa ni Aiziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aiziraeli ahala tsi yosi ya Aamori kula muho Arinoni hadi muho Jaboki, na kula jangbwani hadi muho Joridani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chihivyo Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli waafuta tsi iyo achiahenda atuluke mbere za atue Iziraeli. Dze, unaona unaweza kuafuta nyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vino we uchihewa chitu ni mlunguo Kemoshi kundachihala we chikakala chako? Haya phahi hata swiswi tsi yoyosi ambayo Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu wazola atu mbere zehu ndiyo ambayo hundaihala ikale yehu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.22.1+NUM.22.2+NUM.22.3+NUM.22.4+NUM.22.5+NUM.22.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 22:1–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe kubora kuriko Balaki mwana wa Sipori hata chidide. Iye kala ni mfalume wa Moabu na kayaheha wala kupigana na Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vivi sambi ni muda wa miaka magana mahahu hangu Aiziraeli asagale tsi ya Heshiboni na vidzidzivye, Aroeri na vidzidzivye na midzi yosi iriyo kanda-kanda ya muho Arinoni, kpwa nini tamyaikombola wakati hinyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidzangbwekuhendera uyi, ela uwe unanihendera uyi kpwa kulonda kupigana nami? Mwenyezi Mlungu, ariye muamuli, rero naamule kahi ya Aiziraeli na Aamoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mfalume wa Aamoni warema ujumbe ariophirikirwa ni Jefutha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi roho wa Mwenyezi Mlungu wamwedzera Jefutha, naye achitsupa na Giliadi na Manase na achiphiya hadi Mizipa ya Giliadi na kula Mizipa achiphiya kpwendapigana na Aamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko Jefutha wamuikira Mwenyezi Mlungu naziri achiamba, “Ichikala kpwa kpweli undaatiya Aamoni mwangu mikononi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chochosi ndichotuluka kula mwangu nyumbani kpwedzaniyoyera ndiphokala nkauya na ushindi kpwa kuaturya Aamoni, chindakala chako uwe Mwenyezi Mlungu, nami ndachilavya kukala sadaka ya kuochwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho Jefutha na jeshire avuka kpwendapigana na Aamoni, naye Mwenyezi Mlungu achiatiya mikononi mwa Jefutha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jefutha na jeshire achiapiga na achibananga midzi mirongo miiri kula Aroeri hadi phephi na Minithi na Abeli-Keramimu. Kpwa hivyo atu a Aamoni achishindwa ni Aiziraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jefutha ariphokala anauya kpwakpwe kaya hiko Mizipa, mutu wa kpwandza kumlaki wakala mwanawe wa chichetu, yekala anapiga tamburini kuno anafwiha kpwa kuhamirwa. Ye msichana wakala ni mwana wa macheye. Jefutha kayakala na mwana wanjina wa chilume wala wa chichetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.30.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 30:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi ariphomuona mwanawe wakpwanyula nguwoze kpwa sonono achiamba, “Aa! Mwanangu ukaniweza, ukanitiya sonono, mana naikira Mwenyezi Mlungu naziri, nami siweza kuivundza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye msichana achimuamba ise, “Baba, henda kama urivyomuahidi Mwenyezi Mlungu. Nihenda kama urivyogomba kpwa kukala Mwenyezi Mlungu akakuriphizira chisasi dzulu ya maaduigo, Aamoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achimuamba ise, “Nakuvoya uniphe muda wa miezi miiri niphiye myangoni na asena angu nkarire mana ndafwa kabila ya kulólwa na kuphaha mwana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jefutha achimuamba, “Phiya.” Naye wamupha ruhusa ya miezi miiri. Waphiya na asenae myangoni achendasononeka kpwa sababu kala andafwa bila ya kulólwa na kuphaha mwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya miezi miiri kusira wauya kpwao, naye ise wahenda kama arivyoapa wakati anaika hati, naye achifwa achere mwanamwali. Ihi ichikala desturi ya Aiziraeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kukala chila mwaka asichana a Chiiziraeli nkuphiya myangoni kpwa siku ne kpwa kumtambukira msichana wa Jefutha, Mgiliadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
